# bundle.manifest - the parts of wsl-toolkit.ps1, in the order they are joined.
#
# The defect this file exists to catch is a part that is added and never
# bundled. build.ps1 reads this list AND enumerates every .ps1 under src/,
# core/ and libs/, then refuses when the two disagree in either direction: a
# listed part that does not exist, or an existing part that is not listed. A
# builder that silently skipped a file would produce a script missing a
# function, and the first caller to reach that function is what would report it.
#
# ORDER IS THE WHOLE POINT AND IT IS NOT ALPHABETICAL. PowerShell requires
# param() to be the first statement in a script file, and comment-based help to
# come before it, so src/00-help.ps1 and src/10-parameters.ps1 lead and nothing
# may be moved above them. Everything after is function definitions, which
# PowerShell hoists within a script, so their order is for a reader rather than
# for the parser. src/99-main.ps1 is last because it is the only part that
# EXECUTES rather than declares.
#
# A blank line and a line beginning with # are ignored.

# -- the entry point: help, the parameter surface, and the prelude ----------
src/00-help.ps1
src/10-parameters.ps1
src/20-prelude.ps1

# -- libs: nothing here knows what WSL is ----------------------------------
libs/console.ps1
libs/process.ps1

# -- core: the distro, the command channel, and the safety model -----------
core/wsl-host.ps1
core/distro-exec.ps1
core/command-channel.ps1
core/safety.ps1
core/rootfs.ps1
core/distro-file.ps1

# -- libs again, and the position is deliberate: these are generic, and they
#    sit here because the join order is also the file's reading order -------
libs/native-args.ps1
libs/bounded-process.ps1
libs/stamp.ps1
libs/redact.ps1
libs/events.ps1

# -- core: the stream log, and everything that runs a command --------------
core/stream-log.ps1
core/distro-run.ps1
core/disk.ps1

# -- core: which parameter each action reads, and the dry-run plan ---------
core/applicability.ps1

# -- core: one file per action ---------------------------------------------
core/action-new.ps1
core/action-run.ps1
core/action-resources.ps1
core/action-address.ps1
core/action-purge.ps1
core/action-doctor.ps1

# -- the dispatch, and the only part that executes -------------------------
src/99-main.ps1
